    <section class="qa-hero" aria-labelledby="qaHeroTitle">
        <img class="qa-hero-image"
             src="@Url.Content("~/media/images/preforms-production.jpg")"
             alt=""
             aria-hidden="true" />

        <div class="qa-container qa-hero-content">
            <span class="qa-eyebrow qa-eyebrow-light">ABOUT QPET</span>

            <h1 id="qaHeroTitle">
                Your trusted partner in
                <span>liquid packaging.</span>
            </h1>

            <p>
                A family-owned South African PET converter, manufacturing
                since 1988. From edible oil to water, juice, sauces and
                dairy, QPET delivers reliable supply, premium quality
                and packaging built to grow with your business.
            </p>

            <a href="#aboutStory" class="qa-button">
                Discover our story
                <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="qa-stats" aria-label="QPET key numbers">
        <div class="qa-container">
            <div class="qa-stats-grid">

                <div class="qa-stat">
                    <strong>1988</strong>
                    <span>Manufacturing since</span>
                </div>

                <div class="qa-stat">
                    <strong>35 000 m²</strong>
                    <span>Manufacturing and warehousing space nationally</span>
                </div>

                <div class="qa-stat">
                    <strong>3 Sites</strong>
                    <span>Pietermaritzburg, Johannesburg and Cape Town</span>
                </div>

                <div class="qa-stat">
                    <strong>20 000+ t</strong>
                    <span>PET converted annually across the group</span>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="qa-section qa-story" id="aboutStory">
        <div class="qa-container qa-story-grid">

            <div class="qa-story-copy">
                <span class="qa-eyebrow">WHO WE ARE</span>

                <h2>
                    Family-owned.
                    <span class="qa-gradient">Industry-proven.</span>
                </h2>

                <p>
                    QPET began as a group of entrepreneurs who built their
                    careers at the Willowton Oil Mills plant and grew from
                    there into an independently run PET packaging business.
                    Today, QPET is one of the larger independently owned
                    PET converters in South Africa.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We manufacture injection-moulded preforms, blown bottles,
                    jars and closures. We are a leading supplier to the edible
                    oil industry, and now also serve the mineral water, cold
                    drink, juice, spice and sauce markets.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Innovation, high-quality standards and competitive pricing
                    have kept QPET at the forefront of the edible oil packaging
                    market for over 30 years.
                </p>
            </div>

            <aside class="qa-focus">
                <span class="qa-eyebrow">OUR FOCUS</span>

                <h3>Built around quality and responsibility.</h3>

                <ul class="qa-focus-list">
                    <li>
                        <span class="qa-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                        <span>FSSC 22000 food-safety certification</span>
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        <span class="qa-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                        <span>Level 2 B-BBEE supplier</span>
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        <span class="qa-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                        <span>
                            Responsible Plastics Converter, registered with
                            DFFE and compliant with EWASA as our PRO
                        </span>
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        <span class="qa-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                        <span>Competitive, low-cost production</span>
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        <span class="qa-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                        <span>Latest high-speed manufacturing technology</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </aside>

        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="qa-section qa-purpose">
        <div class="qa-container">

            <div class="qa-heading">
                <span class="qa-eyebrow">MISSION &amp; VISION</span>

                <h2>
                    Where we are today.
                    <span class="qa-gradient">Where we're going.</span>
                </h2>
            </div>

            <div class="qa-purpose-grid">

                <article class="qa-purpose-card">
                    <span class="qa-purpose-label">OUR MISSION</span>

                    <h3>The preferred PET packaging supplier.</h3>

                    <p>
                        To be the preferred supplier of PET bottles to the
                        edible oil, mineral water, fruit juice and beverage
                        markets.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="qa-purpose-card qa-purpose-vision">
                    <span class="qa-purpose-label">OUR VISION</span>

                    <h3>Growing into new markets.</h3>

                    <p>
                        To take our pricing advantage and long-standing
                        technical expertise into new growth sectors,
                        including food, dairy and beverage, while building
                        sustainability into everything we offer.
                    </p>
                </article>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="qa-section qa-manufacturing">
        <div class="qa-container qa-manufacturing-grid">

            <div class="qa-video-card">
                <video autoplay
                       muted
                       loop
                       playsinline
                       preload="metadata"
                       poster="@Url.Content("~/media/images/preforms-production.jpg")"
                       aria-label="QPET manufacturing equipment">

                    <source src="@Url.Content("~/media/videos/manufacturing-machine.mp4")"
                            type="video/mp4" />
                </video>

                <div class="qa-video-caption">
                    <span>MANUFACTURING CAPABILITY</span>
                    <strong>Engineering quality at scale.</strong>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="qa-manufacturing-copy">
                <span class="qa-eyebrow">HOW WE WORK</span>

                <h2>
                    Modern capability with
                    <span class="qa-gradient">efficient production.</span>
                </h2>

                <p class="qa-manufacturing-intro">
                    QPET pairs leading European equipment with decades
                    of technical know-how, giving customers consistent
                    quality, speed and competitive supply.
                </p>

                <div class="qa-process-list">

                    <article class="qa-process-item">
                        <span class="qa-process-mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>

                        <div>
                            <h3>Advanced manufacturing technology</h3>
                            <p>
                                We work with world-leading machine suppliers
                                and expanded our preform, blowing and closure
                                capacity with the latest technology in 2024.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="qa-process-item">
                        <span class="qa-process-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>

                        <div>
                            <h3>Competitive production</h3>
                            <p>
                                As one of the largest independent buyers of PET
                                in the local market, and a low-cost producer,
                                we offer competitive pricing without
                                compromising quality.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="qa-process-item">
                        <span class="qa-process-mark" aria-hidden="true">◇</span>

                        <div>
                            <h3>Local manufacturing innovation</h3>
                            <p>
                                QPET is the first company in South Africa to
                                locally produce both 28mm and 38mm tethered
                                closures.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

   
<section class="qa-section qa-footprint" id="ourFootprint">
    <div class="qa-container">

        <div class="qa-heading">
            <span class="qa-eyebrow">OUR FOOTPRINT</span>

            <h2>
                A national presence that
                <span class="qa-gradient">responds quickly.</span>
            </h2>

            <p>
                Production and distribution sites positioned to support
                customers across South Africa.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="qa-location-grid">

            <article class="qa-location-card">

                <div class="qa-location-visual qa-location-photo">
                    <img src="@Url.Content("~/media/about/pmb-branch.jpg")"
                         alt="Pietermaritzburg manufacturing facility"
                         loading="lazy"
                         decoding="async" />
                </div>

                <div class="qa-location-content">
                    <span class="qa-location-region">
                        KWAZULU-NATAL
                    </span>

                    <h3>Pietermaritzburg</h3>

                    <strong>
                        Head office &amp; main production facility
                    </strong>

                    <p>
                        Preform and closure injection moulding,
                        bottle blowing, jar production and recycling.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </article>

            <article class="qa-location-card">

                <div class="qa-location-visual qa-location-photo">
                    <img src="@Url.Content("~/media/about/jhb-branch.jpg")"
                         alt="Johannesburg industrial manufacturing facility"
                         loading="lazy"
                         decoding="async" />
                </div>

                <div class="qa-location-content">
                    <span class="qa-location-region">
                        GAUTENG
                    </span>

                    <h3>Isando, Johannesburg</h3>

                    <strong>
                        Production facility
                    </strong>

                    <p>
                        Preform injection and bottle blowing,
                        serving customers across the Gauteng region.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </article>

            <article class="qa-location-card">

                <div class="qa-location-visual qa-location-photo">
                    <img src="@Url.Content("~/media/about/cpt-branch.jpg")"
                         alt="Industrial production machinery representing Cape Town operations"
                         loading="lazy"
                         decoding="async" />
                </div>

                <div class="qa-location-content">
                    <span class="qa-location-region">
                        WESTERN CAPE
                    </span>

                    <h3>Maitland, Cape Town</h3>

                    <strong>
                        Distribution site
                    </strong>

                    <p>
                        Storage and distribution, bringing QPET
                        closer to customers in the Western Cape.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </article>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

    <section class="qa-section qa-values">
        <div class="qa-container">

            <div class="qa-heading">
                <span class="qa-eyebrow">WHAT DEFINES QPET</span>

                <h2>
                    Standards and capabilities
                    <span class="qa-gradient">that set us apart.</span>
                </h2>
            </div>

            <div class="qa-values-grid">

                <article class="qa-value-card">
                    <span class="qa-value-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>

                    <h3>Food Safety</h3>
                    <p>
                        FSSC 22000 certification reflects our commitment to
                        recognised food-safety standards in packaging
                        manufacturing.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="qa-value-card">
                    <span class="qa-value-icon" aria-hidden="true">♻</span>

                    <h3>Responsibility</h3>
                    <p>
                        A Responsible Plastics Converter, registered with
                        DFFE and compliant with EWASA as our PRO, with a
                        clear focus on a sustainable future.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="qa-value-card">
                    <span class="qa-value-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</span>

                    <h3>Reliability</h3>
                    <p>
                        A national footprint and local production mean
                        that when you need us, we deliver, from small
                        runs to large-scale production.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="qa-value-card">
                    <span class="qa-value-icon" aria-hidden="true">✧</span>

                    <h3>Innovation</h3>
                    <p>
                        Our injection moulding technology and locally
                        made 28mm and 38mm tethered closures show what
                        South African manufacturing can do.
                    </p>
                </article>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    
